  "Intro_Message": "# Welcome to SWMM\n\nSWMM installs, merges and loads *Breath of the Wild* mods for **Savage Wind**.\n\n1. Open **Settings** and check that SWMM found `savagewind.exe` and your game files. **Detect Savage Wind** fills them in automatically.\n2. Install mods: drag and drop a `.zip`, `.7z`, `.rar` or `.bnp` file onto the window, or pick one in the **Browse** page to download it from GameBanana.\n3. Press **Play**. SWMM merges your mods and starts Savage Wind with them.\n\nYour mods also load when Savage Wind is started on its own. You can turn that off in **Settings**.",
